|passage=''Labrador:''<br>''ò rio, ò rio co'eles.''<br>'''''eis''' uns a cabalo doutros.''
|translation=Farmer:<br>"Let's we throw them to the river."<br>"'''Here they are''' [Watch them], the ones atop the others."}}

